# Medicine App

Read @AGENTS.md in the project root for full conventions.

## Quick Reference

- Expo SDK 56 docs: https://docs.expo.dev/versions/v56.0.0/
- Features in `src/features/`, styles in `css/`, APIs in `api/`
- Chinese UI copy; minimal diffs; no commits unless asked
- API: `isResourceApiOk` + `apiResourceData` from `@/src/utils/apiHelpers`
- Schedule helpers: `scheduleHelpers.ts`; player logic: `playerHelpers.ts`
- Player: training records need >= 1 minute; exit dialogs via `getExitConfirmContent()`
- id给后端传输统一使用string类型